      "review_summary": "The PR forwards Discord `replyToMode` into outbound sends, suppresses trailing native reply references for single-use text/media chunks, and updates chunked Discord reply tests.\n\nPR surface: Source +13, Tests +36. Total +49 across 5 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Current-main source shows `replyTo` flowing into every physical Discord chunk and the linked issue includes shipped-version instrumentation for repeated `message_reference` values; I did not run a live Discord repro in this read-only review.",
