        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(discord): gate replyTo on first chunk for implicit-first replies",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nWith `channels.discord.replyToMode: \"first\"`, chunked replies send the native\nDiscord reply reference on ALL physical chunks, not just the first.  The\nreplied-to person gets N reply notifications for one logical answer.\n\nCloses #99068\n\n## Root Cause / Fix\n\nIn `sendDiscordText`, the `sendChunk` closure captures `replyTo` and passes it\nunconditionally to every chunk body.  The `isFirst` flag controls components\nand embeds but never gates `replyTo`.\n\nFix: add `suppressTrailingReply` flag (default `false` = backward compatible).\nWhen `true`, gate `replyTo` on the first chunk only.  The flag is plumbed\nthrough `sendDiscordText`, `sendDiscordMedia`, and `sendMessageDiscord` opts.\n\nThis preserves `replyTo` on all chunks for explicit reply tags and `\"all\"`\nmode, while suppressing trailing chunks only for implicit single-use\n(`\"first\"`) replies — matching ClawSweeper's guidance.\n\nAlso fix `sendDiscordMedia` trailing-chunk loop to pass `undefined` instead\nof the inherited `replyTo`.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Before (main — bug)\n\n```\nit(\"preserves reply reference across all text chunks\")\n  → ALL chunks get message_reference (bug for first mode)\n```\n\n### After (fix)\n\n```\nit(\"gates implicit-first reply to first text chunk only (#99068)\")\n  → first chunk: reply ✅  trailing chunk: undefined ✅\n\nit(\"gates implicit-first reply to media caption chunk only (#99068)\")\n  → media caption: reply ✅  trailing text: undefined ✅\n\nit(\"preserves reply across all text chunks for explicit/all mode\")\n  → all chunks: reply ✅\n\nit(\"always suppresses reply on media trailing text chunks\")\n  → media caption: reply ✅  trailing: undefined ✅\n```\n\n### Test runner\n\n```\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/discord/src/send.sends-basic-channel-messages.test.ts\n  Tests  46 passed (46)\n```\n\n### Pre-submit\n\n```\noxfmt --check  ✓\noxlint         ✓\ngit diff --check ✓\n```\n\n## Change Type\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Scope\n- [x] Discord channel (send layer)\n\n## Security Impact\n- New permissions? No · Secrets changed? No · New network calls? No\n",
